### Reporting Service – API examples (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP client)

@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@serviceToken = paste-SERVICE-token
@adminToken = paste-ADMIN-token
@organizerToken = paste-ORGANIZER-token-with-tenantId-10
@studentToken = paste-student-token-sub-100

### Health (no token)
GET http://localhost:8092/actuator/health

### --- Feed (owning services) ---

### 1. Event -> 201 CREATED (repeat -> 200 UNCHANGED)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/ingest/events/5
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"tenantId":10,"name":"Losar Raffle","ticketPrice":50,"totalTickets":100,"status":"OPEN",
 "salesCloseAt":"2026-11-20T18:00:00Z","sourceUpdatedAt":"2026-11-01T08:00:00Z"}

### 2. Order confirmed
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/ingest/orders/5001
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":5,"tenantId":10,"buyerId":100,"quantity":2,"amount":100,"status":"CONFIRMED",
 "createdAt":"2026-11-02T09:00:00Z","confirmedAt":"2026-11-02T10:00:00Z","sourceUpdatedAt":"2026-11-02T10:00:00Z"}

### 3. Same order, older version -> 409
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/ingest/orders/5001
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":5,"tenantId":10,"buyerId":100,"quantity":2,"amount":100,"status":"AWAITING_VERIFICATION",
 "createdAt":"2026-11-02T09:00:00Z","sourceUpdatedAt":"2026-11-02T09:05:00Z"}

### 4. Order for an event of another tenant -> 422
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/ingest/orders/5002
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":5,"tenantId":20,"buyerId":100,"quantity":1,"amount":50,"status":"AWAITING_PAYMENT",
 "createdAt":"2026-11-02T09:00:00Z","sourceUpdatedAt":"2026-11-02T09:00:00Z"}

### 5. Prize tier
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/ingest/prizes/70
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":5,"tenantId":10,"tier":1,"name":"Gold coin","quantity":1,"unitValue":60,"sourceUpdatedAt":"2026-11-01T08:00:00Z"}

### 6. Payout paid
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/ingest/payouts/90
Authorization: Bearer {{serviceToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"eventId":5,"tenantId":10,"prizeId":70,"winnerId":100,"amount":60,"status":"PAID",
 "paidAt":"2026-11-25T08:00:00Z","sourceUpdatedAt":"2026-11-25T08:00:00Z"}

### --- Reports (organizer: own tenant only) ---

### 7. Tenant overview
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 8. Events with sales
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/events?status=OPEN&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 9. One event, everything
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/events/5/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 10. Sales in November with daily breakdown
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/sales?eventId=5&from=2026-11-01T00:00:00Z&to=2026-12-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 11. Tickets / prizes / payouts
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/tickets?eventId=5
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/prizes?eventId=5
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/payouts?eventId=5
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 12. Another tenant -> 403
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/overview?tenantId=20
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 13. Admin: any tenant, or platform-wide without tenantId
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/overview?tenantId=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 14. Student: own purchases
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/me/purchases
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### --- Saved reports (organizer) ---

### 15. Create -> 201
POST {{gateway}}/api/reports/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Losar weekly sales","reportType":"SALES","eventId":5,"from":"2026-11-01T00:00:00Z","to":"2026-11-08T00:00:00Z"}

### 16. List / get / run
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/saved
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

###
GET {{gateway}}/api/reports/saved/1/run
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### 17. Update (creator only)
PUT {{gateway}}/api/reports/saved/1
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Losar tickets","reportType":"TICKETS","eventId":5}

### 18. Delete -> 204
DELETE {{gateway}}/api/reports/saved/1
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
